{"vid":"wKCFFwuItmE","source":"wKCFFwuItmE.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":1.7,"txt":"In the oil and natural gas industry,"},{"t":3.7,"txt":"there are critical stages between removing petroleum and gas from underground"},{"t":8.5,"txt":"and making it available at the touch of a switch in homes, schools, and businesses."},{"t":13.7,"txt":"Petroleum pump system operators, refinery operators, and gaugers"},{"t":17.6,"txt":"run the equipment that processes and refines crude petroleum,"},{"t":21.7,"txt":"and they start the process of distributing the fuel by testing it,"},{"t":25.4,"txt":"and feeding it into pipelines."},{"t":27.7,"txt":"Gas plant operators run compressor equipment along pipelines"},{"t":30.9,"txt":"used by utility companies to distribute and process gas."},{"t":35,"txt":"They maintain the all-important specified pressures within the pipelines."},{"t":39.6,"txt":"Gas compressor and gas pumping station operators"},{"t":42.5,"txt":"run the equipment that transmits and pressurizes gases such as butane,"},{"t":47,"txt":"nitrogen, hydrogen, and natural gas."},{"t":49.9,"txt":"Parts of their work locations may be temperature controlled,"},{"t":53,"txt":"but cold outdoor facilities and hot plants filled with noisy machinery"},{"t":57.1,"txt":"are the norm for these workers."},{"t":59.4,"txt":"Hazardous conditions and extreme temperatures"},{"t":61.6,"txt":"mean they wear protective gear much of the time."},{"t":64.6,"txt":"Work schedules are typically at least 40 hours per week, and longer hours are common."},{"t":69.7,"txt":"It’s typically very physical, exhausting work,"},{"t":72.7,"txt":"although staying safe and effective is essential even when stamina is running thin."},{"t":77.7,"txt":"Most positions require a high school diploma or equivalent,"},{"t":81.5,"txt":"and earning professional certifications may be helpful for job seekers in this field."}],"words":[{"t":1.666,"w":"In"},{"t":1.666,"w":"the"},{"t":1.666,"w":"oil"},{"t":1.666,"w":"and"},{"t":1.